WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.718
In tutorial 8.10, you'll choose extra AI
checks, see what each one costs in credits,

00:00:11.768 --> 00:00:13.378
and price a repeat test.

00:00:14.408 --> 00:00:18.303
First, open Website settings,
then Tracking & monitors.

00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:21.471
Under AI visibility,
click More engine options.

00:00:22.434 --> 00:00:26.759
Each option says what it adds and
how many credits a month it changes,

00:00:26.809 --> 00:00:29.395
like sending each buyer
role with the question.

00:00:30.476 --> 00:00:35.126
Or track how often AI names businesses
in your whole market, month by month,

00:00:35.176 --> 00:00:36.670
with its own credits shown.

00:00:37.694 --> 00:00:42.704
Next, tick Ask Claude every week, and choose
which assistants the daily pulse asks,

00:00:42.754 --> 00:00:44.082
like Perplexity here.

00:00:45.119 --> 00:00:47.844
The estimate on the right
updates as you choose,

00:00:47.894 --> 00:00:50.441
so you see the monthly
credits before you save.

00:00:51.644 --> 00:00:56.167
Then choose how many of the searches
assistants make before answering are checked

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:58.541
each week, to see whether
you rank for them.

00:01:00.144 --> 00:01:04.044
Under Share of voice counted against,
add the brands to compare with,

00:01:04.094 --> 00:01:06.551
so the figure stays
comparable week to week.

00:01:07.619 --> 00:01:11.981
When you're happy, click Save monitors,
or Undo changes to start again.

00:01:13.665 --> 00:01:19.190
Finally, on AI visibility, Repeat pilot
asks the same questions again and again,

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.971
to show how much each
assistant's answer moves.

00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:26.705
Click Get the price. It shows what
the test will cost in credits,

00:01:26.755 --> 00:01:28.316
and getting it costs nothing.

00:01:29.455 --> 00:01:32.255
To go ahead, click the
Run the pilot button.

00:01:32.305 --> 00:01:36.705
A last check shows the credits
again, with Run the pilot and Cancel.

00:01:36.755 --> 00:01:38.920
Nothing runs until you confirm.

00:01:39.893 --> 00:01:44.593
So you add only the checks you need, and
you see their credits before anything runs.

00:01:45.918 --> 00:01:51.298
So, open More engine options, pick checks
and read each price, set the assistants,

00:01:51.348 --> 00:01:54.982
check the searches behind answers,
and price the repeat test.

00:01:56.027 --> 00:02:00.262
Now your extra checks are set.
Next, see what AI gets wrong,

00:02:00.312 --> 00:02:03.902
and whether it can read
your site, in tutorial 8.11.
